    "Erase and Restart" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Borrar y reiniciar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "抹掉并重新开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase everything and start over?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Borrar todo y empezar de cero?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "抹掉所有内容并重新开始？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erases every Imp, service, key, tool, trigger, chat and setting. Imp opens as new." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Borra todos los Imps, servicios, claves, herramientas, disparadores, chats y ajustes. Imp se abre como nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除所有 Imp、服务、密钥、工具、触发器、对话和设置。Imp 将以全新状态打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every %lld hours" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada %lld horas"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每 %lld 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Imp" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los Imps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有 Imp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Imp answers these. Clicks go to the Imp you click, everything else to the one you talked to last." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los Imps responden a estos. Los clics van al Imp que pulses; todo lo demás, al último con el que hablaste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个 Imp 都会响应这些。点按交给你点的 Imp，其他的交给你最后交谈的 Imp。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Imp has a favourite colour. Land on it and you'll know." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada Imp tiene un color favorito. Cae en él y lo sabrás."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个 Imp 都有最喜欢的颜色。选中它你就知道了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Imp hatches with a brain to chat and a shell to get things done. It waits here until you let it out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada Imp nace con un cerebro para chatear y una terminal para hacer cosas. Espera aquí hasta que lo dejes salir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个 Imp 孵化时都带着用来对话的大脑和用来办事的终端。它会在这里等你放它出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Imp on %@ uses it, unless one picks its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los Imps en %@ lo usan, salvo que uno elija el suyo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 上的所有 Imp 都使用它，除非某个 Imp 另选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Imp, service, key, tool, trigger, chat and setting is deleted. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se eliminan todos los Imps, servicios, claves, herramientas, disparadores, chats y ajustes. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有 Imp、服务、密钥、工具、触发器、对话和设置都将被删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every chat with %@, newest first. Continue one to pick up where you left off: %@ remembers it as it was. Save one as a file to keep it or to carry it on with another Imp or on another Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Every chat with %1$@, newest first. Continue one to pick up where you left off: %2$@ remembers it as it was. Save one as a file to keep it or to carry it on with another Imp or on another Mac."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los chats con %1$@, los más recientes primero. Continúa uno para seguir donde lo dejaste: %2$@ lo recuerda tal como estaba. Guarda uno como archivo para conservarlo o continuarlo con otro Imp o en otro Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与 %1$@ 的所有聊天，最新的在前。继续某个聊天即可接着聊：%2$@ 记得它原来的样子。把聊天存为文件，可以保留它，或与另一个 Imp、在另一台 Mac 上继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every condition must be true when it goes off, like the battery being low or the time being late." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todas las condiciones deben cumplirse cuando se activa, como que la batería esté baja o que sea tarde."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "触发时必须满足所有条件，例如电池电量低或时间已晚。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every day at" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada día a las"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every day at %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada día a las %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every few minutes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada pocos minutos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每隔几分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every hour" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada hora"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything you and %@ said, with the tools it used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todo lo que tú y %@ dijisteis, con las herramientas que usó."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你和 %@ 说过的一切，以及它用过的工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exactly!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
