      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saltito"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蹦跳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hops and wobbles with laughter." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salta y se tambalea de risa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "笑得又蹦又晃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horns" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuernos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "角"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How %@ always looks and moves: tired eyes, a frown, droopy horns, a slower pace. It shows in every mood and animation, and while it follows the cursor." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo se ve y se mueve %@ siempre: ojos cansados, ceño fruncido, cuernos caídos, un ritmo más lento. Se nota en todos los ánimos y animaciones, y mientras sigue el cursor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 平时的样子和动作：疲惫的眼睛、皱起的眉头、耷拉的角、较慢的节奏。无论哪种心情和动画，以及跟随指针时，都会体现出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How %@ talks. Start from a template, then edit the words." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo habla %@. Empieza con una plantilla y luego edita el texto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的说话方式。从模板开始，再修改文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How audio shows in a bubble. Chats always have players." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo se muestra el audio en una burbuja. Los chats siempre tienen reproductores."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音频在气泡中的显示方式。对话中总是显示播放器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it feels during this beat. Keep: whatever it feels anyway." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo se siente durante este paso. Mantener: lo que sienta de todos modos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此节拍中它的感受。保持：它本来的感受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long it plays (%@ plays it at its own pace)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuánto dura (%@ la reproduce a su propio ritmo)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "播放时长（%@ 按自己的节奏播放）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many recent exchanges are sent with each message. More remembers more, but each message is bigger, slower and costs more: recap a long chat to keep it small. Older ones stay in the chat to read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuántos intercambios recientes se envían con cada mensaje. Más recuerda más, pero cada mensaje es más grande, más lento y cuesta más: resume un chat largo para mantenerlo pequeño. Los anteriores siguen en el chat para leerlos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条消息附带发送多少轮最近的对话。越多记得越多，但每条消息更大、更慢、更贵：长聊天可以总结来保持精简。更早的内容仍留在聊天中可供阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times it goes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuántas veces lo hace"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做几次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Huge" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enorme"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hum a tune" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tararear"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哼小曲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hums a love song, hearts drifting up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tararea una canción de amor mientras suben corazones."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哼着情歌，爱心向上飘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I bite. Metaphorically. Mostly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muerdo. En sentido figurado. Casi siempre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我会咬人。比喻意义上的。大多数时候。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I can't hear you. Turn on the microphone for Imp in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No te oigo. Activa el micrófono para Imp en Ajustes del Sistema › Privacidad y seguridad › Micrófono."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我听不到你。请在“系统设置” › “隐私与安全性” › “麦克风”中为 Imp 打开麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I didn't catch that. Type it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No te entendí. ¿Lo escribes?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我没听清。要打字吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I don't know" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No lo sé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我不知道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I don't know a trigger called “%@”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No conozco ningún disparador llamado “%@”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我不知道名为“%@”的触发器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I heard nothing. Not even a whisper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No oí nada. Ni un susurro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "什么也没听到，连一声耳语都没有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I wasn't allowed to read the %@ key from your Keychain. Ask again and choose Allow, or paste the key in All Imps › Services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No me dejaron leer la clave de %@ de tu llavero. Vuelve a pedirlo y elige Permitir, o pega la clave en Todos los Imps › Servicios."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我无权从你的钥匙串读取 %@ 密钥。请重试并选择“允许”，或在“所有 Imp › 服务”中粘贴密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm a demon, not a stress ball." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Soy un demonio, no una pelota antiestrés."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我是恶魔，不是减压球。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm not sure" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No estoy seguro"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我不确定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
