          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saca a %@ para chatear, resumir o empezar un chat nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 %@ 放出来对话、回顾或开始新对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let %@ out to continue this chat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deja salir a %@ para continuar este chat"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 %@ 出来才能继续此聊天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let %@ use it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dejar que %@ lo use"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 %@ 使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets %@ run commands on your Mac, like opening apps or reading files. They run with your permissions, without asking first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite que %@ ejecute comandos en tu Mac, como abrir apps o leer archivos. Se ejecutan con tus permisos, sin preguntar antes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 %@ 在你的 Mac 上运行命令，例如打开 App 或读取文件。命令以你的权限运行，事先不会询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets %@ use %@. It stays on this Mac and is shared by every Imp on %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Lets %1$@ use %2$@. It stays on this Mac and is shared by every Imp on %3$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite que %@ use %@. Se queda en este Mac y la comparten todos los Imps de %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 %@ 使用 %@。它保存在这台 Mac 上，由 %@ 上的所有 Imp 共用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Imps hear you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite que los Imps te oigan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 Imp 能听到你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets an Imp click and type in other apps. Only for computer control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite que un Imp haga clic y escriba en otras apps. Solo para controlar el ordenador."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 Imp 能在其他 App 中点按和输入。仅用于电脑控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets an Imp see the app it operates. Only for computer control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite que un Imp vea la app que maneja. Solo para el control del ordenador."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 Imp 看到它操作的 App。仅用于电脑控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your iPhone reach this Mac from anywhere, not just on your Wi-Fi. The server only passes encrypted data along. It can't read anything." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite que tu iPhone llegue a este Mac desde cualquier lugar, no solo en tu Wi-Fi. El servidor solo reenvía datos cifrados. No puede leer nada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让你的 iPhone 在任何地方都能连到这台 Mac，而不只是在你的 Wi-Fi 上。服务器只转发加密数据，什么也读不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
