    "The Imp extension for Chrome, Brave, Edge, Firefox or Safari tells Imps which website you're on. It talks only to Imp on this Mac. The button shows its folder, with a README on adding it to each browser. Pin it: its popup shows whether it's connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La extensión de Imp para Chrome, Brave, Edge, Firefox o Safari les dice a los Imps en qué sitio web estás. Solo se comunica con Imp en este Mac. El botón muestra su carpeta, con un README que explica cómo añadirla a cada navegador. Fíjala: su ventana emergente muestra si está conectada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适用于 Chrome、Brave、Edge、Firefox 或 Safari 的 Imp 扩展会告诉 Imp 你正在浏览哪个网站。它只与这台 Mac 上的 Imp 通信。按钮会显示它的文件夹，其中的 README 说明了如何把它添加到各个浏览器。将其固定：它的弹出窗口会显示是否已连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The MCP server closed the connection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor MCP cerró la conexión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCP 服务器关闭了连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The MCP server closed the connection: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor MCP cerró la conexión: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCP 服务器关闭了连接：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is hot" : {
