          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sitio web"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website open" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sitio web abierto"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站已打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What %@ can do by itself. Its model decides when to use each one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que %@ puede hacer por sí mismo. Su modelo decide cuándo usar cada una."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 能自己做的事。由它的模型决定何时使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What %@ is sent from the chat you're in. Every chat is saved: carry on in an older one, save it as a file, or bring one in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que se le envía a %@ del chat en el que estás. Todos los chats se guardan: continúa uno anterior, guárdalo como archivo o trae uno."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从当前聊天发送给 %@ 的内容。每个聊天都会保存：可以继续旧聊天、存为文件，或导入一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Imp did" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que hizo Imp"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp 做了什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you call it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cómo lo llamas?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你叫它什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is it called?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cómo se llama?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它叫什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it does when you play with the cursor: circle it, stroke its head, tickle it, stare at it. Stroking needs slow strokes to and fro." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qué hace cuando juegas con el cursor: rodearlo, acariciarle la cabeza, hacerle cosquillas, mirarlo fijamente. Para acariciar hacen falta pasadas lentas de un lado a otro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你用指针和它玩耍时它会做什么：绕圈、抚摸它的头、挠痒、盯着它。抚摸需要缓慢地来回划动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it looks like, in a few words" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo se ve, en pocas palabras"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用几个词描述它的样子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it's called, its icon in the list, and which Imps play it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cómo se llama, su icono en la lista y qué Imps la reproducen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它叫什么、在列表中的图标，以及哪些 Imp 播放它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should %@ do with it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Qué debería hacer %@ con esto?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 应该怎么处理它？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should %@ do?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Qué debe hacer %@?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 该做什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What starts %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qué inicia a %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "什么会启动 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What was said and %@'s memory of it are gone for good. Save it as a file first to keep it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que se dijo y lo que %@ recuerda de ello desaparecen para siempre. Guárdalo antes como archivo para conservarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聊天内容和 %@ 对它的记忆将被永久删除。要保留请先存为文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wheee!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Yuju!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "呜呼！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuándo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it goes off, %@ gets the instruction and what happened, then decides what to do with its tools. Or it just opens something, like the text box." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando se dispara, %@ recibe la instrucción y lo que pasó, y decide qué hacer con sus herramientas. O simplemente abre algo, como el cuadro de texto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "触发时，%@ 会收到指令和发生的事，然后决定用工具做什么。或者只是打开某样东西，比如文本框。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it's quiet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando está tranquilo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安静时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When something happens, the Imp gets your instruction and what happened, then decides what to do. Keys work anywhere on your Mac. You can also ask %@ to set one up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando pasa algo, el Imp recibe tu instrucción y lo que pasó, y decide qué hacer. Las teclas funcionan en cualquier parte del Mac. También puedes pedirle a %@ que configure uno."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发生某件事时，Imp 会收到你的指令和发生的事，然后决定怎么做。按键在 Mac 上任何地方都有效。你也可以让 %@ 来设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where %@ thinks. Any OpenAI-compatible service, in the cloud or on this Mac. The star marks the one new Imps use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dónde piensa %@. Cualquier servicio compatible con OpenAI, en la nube o en este Mac. La estrella marca el que usan los Imps nuevos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 在哪里思考。任何兼容 OpenAI 的服务，云端或本机均可。星标表示新 Imp 使用的服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where a message from one Imp to another goes. Your chat is the one you have with the Imp that receives it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adónde va un mensaje de un Imp a otro. Tu chat es el que tienes con el Imp que lo recibe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个 Imp 发给另一个 Imp 的消息去往何处。“你的对话”是指你与接收方 Imp 的对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who gets the triggers, tools and animations that aren't an Imp's own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quién recibe los disparadores, herramientas y animaciones que no son de un Imp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "谁接收不属于某个 Imp 的触发器、工具和动画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
